{"id":"c23","stage":3,"title":"一条新闻可靠吗","scene":"讨论核实信息的方法。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c23-1","ko":"인터넷에서 흥미로운 기사를 봤어요.","zh":"我在网上看到一篇有趣的报道。","note":"기사 在这里指新闻报道。","words":[{"term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","id":"020698f8f7c78429","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"},{"term":"흥미롭다","zh":"有趣","id":"52f6e629edb6c5ae","audio":"/audio/52f6e629edb6c5aee8ae.mp3"},{"term":"기사","zh":"新闻报道","id":"1f896d183072b812","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/fb3e69cc733074e9f2ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"인터넷에서","meaning":"在网上","explanation":"인터넷（互联网）+ 에서（动作地点）。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인터넷에서","audio":"/audio/4c64cbe15d925473bffd.mp3"}},{"text":"흥미로운","meaning":"有趣的","explanation":"흥미롭다（有趣）→ 흥미로운，ㅂ不规则的定语形。","readings":[{"term":"흥미롭다","audio":"/audio/52f6e629edb6c5aee8ae.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흥미로운","audio":"/audio/2cfcff28c86d0a0208d6.mp3"}},{"text":"기사를","meaning":"报道","explanation":"기사（新闻报道）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"기사","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기사를","audio":"/audio/35de5cb519d0fe4b8667.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어요.","meaning":"看到了","explanation":"보다（看）的过去礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"봤어요","audio":"/audio/c0a52b735e5a5e2481b8.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어요","audio":"/audio/c0a52b735e5a5e2481b8.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c23-2","ko":"출처가 어디인지 확인했어요?","zh":"你确认出处了吗？","note":"-인지 将疑问嵌入句子。","words":[{"term":"출처","zh":"出处","id":"fa543a9d6cf32498","audio":"/audio/fa543a9d6cf324986fbd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a0ef21c0aa95fa587280.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"출처가","meaning":"出处","explanation":"출처（出处）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"출처","audio":"/audio/fa543a9d6cf324986fbd.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출처가","audio":"/audio/7117a94e9ecdd861ab4d.mp3"}},{"text":"어디인지","meaning":"是哪里","explanation":"어디（哪里）+ 이다（是）+ -ㄴ지（嵌入疑问）。","readings":[{"term":"어디인지","audio":"/audio/aacc67524b32e471fc9e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디인지","audio":"/audio/aacc67524b32e471fc9e.mp3"}},{"text":"확인했어요?","meaning":"确认了吗？","explanation":"확인하다（确认）的过去礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"확인했어요","audio":"/audio/0aa4f812beacfaf00063.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확인했어요","audio":"/audio/0aa4f812beacfaf00063.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c23-3","ko":"제목만 보고 믿을 뻔했어요.","zh":"我差点只看标题就信了。","note":"-ㄹ 뻔하다 表示差点发生。","words":[{"term":"제목","zh":"标题","id":"08b17e433630742b","audio":"/audio/08b17e433630742bc700.mp3"},{"term":"믿다","zh":"相信","id":"03fdf42bef953df4","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/11ccd1d914030aac13c0.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"제목만","meaning":"只看标题","explanation":"제목（标题）+ 만（只）。","readings":[{"term":"제목","audio":"/audio/08b17e433630742bc700.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제목만","audio":"/audio/9d537da3f24c2a9906f6.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看后","explanation":"보다（看）+ -고（连接动作）。","readings":[{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"믿을","meaning":"相信","explanation":"믿다（相信）+ -을，修饰뻔。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"믿을","audio":"/audio/d633bb4b6c30aa84c40a.mp3"}},{"text":"뻔했어요.","meaning":"差点","explanation":"뻔하다的过去礼貌形式；-(으)ㄹ 뻔하다表示差点发生但未发生。","readings":[{"term":"뻔했어요","audio":"/audio/7410fba85042c58d9dd6.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뻔했어요","audio":"/audio/7410fba85042c58d9dd6.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c23-4","ko":"다른 언론의 보도와 비교해 보는 게 좋아요.","zh":"最好和其他媒体的报道比较一下。","note":"建议通过多个报道交叉核实。","words":[{"term":"언론","zh":"新闻媒体","id":"1acee34604f080d6","audio":"/audio/1acee34604f080d6dc92.mp3"},{"term":"보도","zh":"报道","id":"8674bc121e10b64d","audio":"/audio/8674bc121e10b64d9281.mp3"},{"term":"비교하다","zh":"比较","id":"a42ff5cd8ca0b909","audio":"/audio/a42ff5cd8ca0b9097ee9.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/70c8141a46c5b132d594.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他的","explanation":"다르다（不同）的定语形式，此处意为“其他的”。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"언론의","meaning":"媒体的","explanation":"언론（新闻媒体）+ 의（所属、修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"언론","audio":"/audio/1acee34604f080d6dc92.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언론의","audio":"/audio/1d88a5110734d4e708dd.mp3"}},{"text":"보도와","meaning":"报道和","explanation":"보도（报道）+ 와（比较的对象）。","readings":[{"term":"보도","audio":"/audio/8674bc121e10b64d9281.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보도와","audio":"/audio/2d20d13c372626223bd5.mp3"}},{"text":"비교해","meaning":"比较","explanation":"비교하다（比较）→ 비교해，连接보다。","readings":[{"term":"비교하다","audio":"/audio/a42ff5cd8ca0b9097ee9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비교해","audio":"/audio/65b8937b0f00fe93eb44.mp3"}},{"text":"보는","meaning":"试着做的","explanation":"보다 + -는（定语形）；-아/어 보다表示尝试。","readings":[{"term":"보는","audio":"/audio/8103e7fed907b17e57e3.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보는","audio":"/audio/8103e7fed907b17e57e3.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"事","explanation":"것이的缩略，将比较行为名词化作主语。","readings":[{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"较好","explanation":"좋다的礼貌形式；-는 게 좋다表示建议。","readings":[{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c23-5","ko":"사진도 맥락에 따라 의미가 달라질 수 있겠네요.","zh":"照片的含义也可能随语境改变呢。","note":"에 따라：根据、随着。","words":[{"term":"맥락","zh":"语境；背景","id":"528e76d8671d362f","audio":"/audio/528e76d8671d362f2e62.mp3"},{"term":"의미","zh":"意义","id":"adfc8cc897bfb433","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3"},{"term":"달라지다","zh":"改变","id":"3aa18124b2a7d459","audio":"/audio/3aa18124b2a7d459478f.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/4de2016a5fc6a8a992df.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"사진도","meaning":"照片也","explanation":"사진（照片）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"사진도","audio":"/audio/b43e1b5a620878a8400c.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진도","audio":"/audio/b43e1b5a620878a8400c.mp3"}},{"text":"맥락에","meaning":"根据语境","explanation":"맥락（语境、背景）+ 에，与따라组成“根据”。","readings":[{"term":"맥락","audio":"/audio/528e76d8671d362f2e62.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맥락에","audio":"/audio/1c588d8a69e174c9e4ce.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"随","explanation":"따르다（跟随）的连接形式；에 따라是惯用搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"의미가","meaning":"含义","explanation":"의미（意义）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"의미","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의미가","audio":"/audio/701e65383456a4ff01b7.mp3"}},{"text":"달라질","meaning":"变化","explanation":"달라지다（变得不同）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"달라지다","audio":"/audio/3aa18124b2a7d459478f.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라질","audio":"/audio/e7d1c358b54840d369ff.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다表示可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있겠네요.","meaning":"也可能会呢","explanation":"있다 + -겠-（推测）+ -네요（新认识）。","readings":[{"term":"있겠네요","audio":"/audio/d401301eb596c3368320.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있겠네요","audio":"/audio/d401301eb596c3368320.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c23-6","ko":"맞아요. 확인되지 않은 정보는 공유하지 않으려고 해요.","zh":"是的，我尽量不分享未经证实的信息。","note":"확인되지 않은：尚未得到确认的。","words":[{"term":"정보","zh":"信息","id":"b8cf07ac906c8124","audio":"/audio/b8cf07ac906c812405b2.mp3"},{"term":"공유하다","zh":"分享","id":"c2d7d5f37d09f376","audio":"/audio/c2d7d5f37d09f37662ac.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/aa79d2569002371a0d67.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"是的","explanation":"맞다（对、正确）的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}},{"text":"확인되지","meaning":"得到确认","explanation":"확인되다（被确认）+ -지，连接否定。","readings":[{"term":"확인되지","audio":"/audio/5e1233c2c226c3f70ddf.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확인되지","audio":"/audio/5e1233c2c226c3f70ddf.mp3"}},{"text":"않은","meaning":"未……的","explanation":"않다（不）+ -은（定语形），与前文组成“未被确认的”。","readings":[{"term":"않은","audio":"/audio/a9f714aa2b4d9c2deacb.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않은","audio":"/audio/a9f714aa2b4d9c2deacb.mp3"}},{"text":"정보는","meaning":"信息","explanation":"정보（信息）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"정보","audio":"/audio/b8cf07ac906c812405b2.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정보는","audio":"/audio/760419118afc405c2fbd.mp3"}},{"text":"공유하지","meaning":"分享","explanation":"공유하다（分享）+ -지，连接않다。","readings":[{"term":"공유하다","audio":"/audio/c2d7d5f37d09f37662ac.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공유하지","audio":"/audio/a2f9720a178b0fd281dd.mp3"}},{"text":"않으려고","meaning":"打算不","explanation":"않다 + -으려고（意图）。","readings":[{"term":"않으려고","audio":"/audio/a1dd8a4bac02fed4b286.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않으려고","audio":"/audio/a1dd8a4bac02fed4b286.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"打算","explanation":"하다→해요；整体表示“不打算分享／尽量不分享”。","readings":[{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}]}],"day":111,"sequenceScore":1.96,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["我只看标题就完全相信了。","我差点只看标题就信了。","我差点连标题都没看。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["照片的含义不会随语境改变。","照片的尺寸也可能随设备改变。","照片的含义也可能随语境改变呢。"],"answer":2}]}
